  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8e2e2318533cdee478cc197dc2db33bc, type: 3}
  m_Name: PoolProblem
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  displayImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fc96920d44bf1e54fad0c24adeec776f, type: 3}
  displayText: Pool balls are numbered 1 through 15. <br> Add them up, bonus points
    for coming up with a fast way to do so. <br> Hint, average two numbers. How can
    they be equal?
  solutionImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fc96920d44bf1e54fad0c24adeec776f, type: 3}
  solutionText: 120 <br> Fastest way to solve this is by calculating the average
    of the numbers. <br> Average(1,15) = 8 <br> 8 * 15 = 80 + 40 = 120
